  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.serveratelier.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.serveratelier.com/assets/themes/atelier/assets/images/banner/sa_budget.png\" alt=\"Получите свой бюджетный игровой сервер уже сегодня на ServerAtelier\"></a></p>\n<h1>УСТАРЕЛО!</h1>\n<h2>Вместо него используйте <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rays-levelz-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">RAY's LevelZ Compat</a>.</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xR4YM0ND/Let-s-Do-Compat-LevelZ/refs/heads/1.20.1/Gallery/letsdocompatlevelz_title_wide.png\" alt=\"letsdocompatlevelz_title\"></p>\n<p>этот мод добавляет поддержку нескольких <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fsatisfyu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">модов Let's Do</a> и <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flevelz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LevelZ</a></p>\n<h2>Поддерживаемые моды</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-bakery-farmcharm-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Bakery - Farm&Charm Compat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-beachparty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Beachparty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-bloomingnature\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] BloomingNature</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-brewery-farmcharm-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Brewery - Farm&Charm Compat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-camping\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Camping</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-candlelight-farmcharm-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Candlelight - Farm&Charm Compat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-farm-charm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Farm & Charm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-herbalbrews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] HerbalBrews</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-lilis-lucky-lures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Lili's Lucky Lures</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-meadow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Meadow</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-nethervinery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] NetherVinery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-vinery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Vinery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-wildernature\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] WilderNature</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Настройка</h2>\n<p>Вы можете отключить каждую совместимость в файле конфигурации <code>letsdocompatlevelz.json5</code>.</p>\n<p><em>Совместимости загружаются только если мод установлен & параметр в конфиге установлен в true (по умолчанию)</em></p>\n<h2>Благодарности</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/WXdSYn4yHB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/745451299713056791?color=7289DA&label=DISCORD&logo=discord&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord Fabricated Atelier\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/xR4YM0ND/Let-s-Do-Compat-LevelZ/blob/1.20.1/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/xR4YM0ND/NutritionZ?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Лицензия GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/xR4YM0ND/Let-s-Do-Compat-LevelZ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-Source_Code-lightgrey?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Исходный код GitHub\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fxR4YM0ND\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-xR4YM0ND-1bd96a?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"xR4YM0ND на Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/spigotde/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Curseforge-xR4YM0ND-f16436?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"xR4YM0ND на Curseforge\"></a></p>",
